  "releaseNotes": "Release history: https://github.com/SteffenCarlsen/ModernOverlay.NET/releases. Includes retained controls, layout panels, selective click-through input-region integration, popup controls, text input, theme hooks/readability checks, and dynamic placement with interface-only layout persistence. Targets net11.0-windows on a prerelease .NET 11 SDK and follows the same DWM/color-key fallback caveats as the core overlay package; UI Automation providers, IME composition, clipboard editing, ScrollViewer, virtualization, and built-in JSON/file layout stores are out of scope for the core package.",
